<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><i>Ratification of Selection of Ernst &amp; Young</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">The Company&#8217;s stockholders ratified the
selection of Ernst &amp; Young LLP as the independent registered public accounting firm of the Company for its fiscal year ending December
31, 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 90%; margin-left: 0.25in">
